    Bug 1901962 - Add new tests which open (almost) all subdialogs in preferences. r=mkmelin
    These new tests open and then close the preferences subdialogs which don't already have tests,
    except those for the primary password.

    No actual testing happens on the dialogs, except to prove that the right page opens and loads
    without an uncaught exception. The idea is to add the bare minimum of testing, which can be
    built upon later.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D214684

